# UI design system

**Contracts:** [design_tokens_contract.md](../../docs/implementation/contracts/design_tokens_contract.md) · [game_kit_contract.md](../../docs/implementation/contracts/game_kit_contract.md)

- Токены портала — `shared/styles/tokens.css` (R03)
- Примитивы — только `shared/ui/`
- Игровой каркас — только `shared/game-kit/`
- Запрет «сырых» цветов вне токенов (`bg-[#…]`)
- shadcn — через `shared/ui`, не дублировать в играх

**Source of truth:** [`design_tokens_contract.md`](docs/implementation/contracts/design_tokens_contract.md) до отдельного visual identity (UX-03).
**Typography:** [`docs/guidelines/typography_text_guidelines.md`](docs/guidelines/typography_text_guidelines.md)  
**Methodology:** [`docs/meta/ai_first_methodology.md`](docs/meta/ai_first_methodology.md)

**Theme:** semantic CSS variables in `app/globals.css` — `:root` and `.dark` on `<html>` (`next-themes`), plus `@theme inline` for Tailwind v4.

## Principles

- **Character:** palette, mood and shape language — from the visual identity contract, not shadcn defaults or generic SaaS gray.
- **Typography:** heading / UI / mono font roles via `next/font` in the root layout (`font-heading` for titles); families and subsets — from the visual identity contract.
- **Hierarchy:** corners, elevation and emphasis per design system.
- *EdenGames example (Warm Forest):* forest greens + gold accents; Source Serif 4 / Manrope / JetBrains Mono; Material You shapes.
- **Mobile-first:** bottom nav `< md`, sidebar `≥ md` per user flows — full contract: **ui-mobile-first**.
- **Prototype fidelity:** fonts, sizes, weights, colors from prototype + design system — **ui-prototype-fidelity**.

## Tokens

- Semantic classes: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-card`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `text-primary-foreground`, `ring-ring`.
- **Primary** — main CTAs; **accent** — badges/highlights; do not swap roles.
- New colors: define in `:root` / `.dark` **and** map in `@theme inline`.

## States (first-class UX)

Design explicitly: **empty**, **loading**, **error**, **forbidden**.

- Loading: skeletons / Suspense ([ai_loading_patterns.md](docs/guidelines/nextjs/ai_loading_patterns.md)).
- Field errors: `border-destructive`, error text per design system §forms.

## Agent checklist

- One **Primary CTA** per screen — `Button` `default` variant.
- Do not bypass PRD with client-side business logic.
- **Accessibility:** contrast, focus, labels, semantic HTML — full contract: **ui-semantics-a11y** (WCAG 2.1 AA).
- **Responsive:** edge-to-edge mobile patterns from design system where specified.

## Primitives

shadcn on **Base UI**: Card, Button, Tabs, Dialog, Sheet, Table, Form/Field/Label, Alert, Skeleton — install via shadcn MCP, then tokenize.

- Init: `shadcn init -b base`. In `components.json`, `"style": "base-vega"`.
- Primitive package: `@base-ui/react`.
- Compose with the Base UI `render` prop.
- **MUST NOT:** `shadcn init -b radix`, a `radix-*` style, or `@radix-ui/*` as the shadcn primitive layer.

## Design Lab catalog (product UI — MUST)

Product screens **MUST** compose UI from the **canonical shared catalog** visualized on the dev-only **Design Lab** at `/design-system` (`app/(dev)/design-system/`). Spec: [`design_tokens_contract.md`](docs/implementation/contracts/design_tokens_contract.md).

| Layer | Catalog path | Import alias | Examples |
|-------|--------------|--------------|----------|
| Typography atoms | `components/atoms/` | `@/components/atoms` | `Heading`, `SectionTitle`, `ContentText`, `AlertText` |
| Tokenized primitives | `components/ui/` | `@/components/ui/*` | `Button`, `CustomLink`, `Card`, `Container`, project card primitive (EdenGames: `EdenGamesCard`), shadcn primitives |
| Design tokens | `app/globals.css` | semantic Tailwind classes | `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, elevation/radius vars |
| L3 composed patterns | Design Lab L3 sections + [`design_tokens_contract.md`](docs/implementation/contracts/design_tokens_contract.md) | reuse recipes from catalog | KPI card, empty state, section header |

**MUST NOT:** import showcase wrappers from `@/components/design-lab/**` in product routes; duplicate primitive markup already on Design Lab — extend CVA/atom variant and add a Lab section first.

**Workflow:** open `/design-system` locally → pick catalog import → verify variant on 390px and `md`.

Reference: EdenGames (docs/examples/ai_first_tmp) `ui-calm-editorial-shadcn.mdc` — Warm Forest adaptation.
